    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: 'Welcome to Cheese Town! I''m Mayor Ellis.


    We''re happy to have you here. Use your axe on a cheese tree, then walk over the dropped cheese to collect it. Gather 10 cheeses, and I''ll write again.


    Use your tablet to read letters and visit UPGRADES. Enjoy your first day!


    Mayor Ellis'
